        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5073 Knob With 5046 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUndeniably alluring in design, this solid brass Baldwin made knobset will add a modern accent to any door. The octagon shape of this 5073 knob paired with the round 5046 rosette makes for a very contemporary look. It will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5073 Contemporary Knob With Matching 5046 Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Modern Octagon Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button located on rose. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Octagon Knobset, Baldwin 5073",
                "description": "Baldwin Estate Collection 5073 Knob With 5046 Rose - Undeniably alluring in design, this solid brass Baldwin made knobset will add a modern accent to any door. It is available in 8 finishes. The octagon shape of this 5073 knob paired with the round 5006 rosette makes for a very contemporary look. It will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch.",
